ent-ShieldGeneratorMS750 = MS-750 "Prometheus" Shield Generator
    .suffix = ADS ONLY
    .desc = Pre-fracture shielding salvaged from a sealed armoury. Massive capacity, radiates while active, and overloads catastrophically.
ent-ShieldGeneratorMS1000 = MS-1000 "Triptych" Shield Generator
    .suffix = ADS ONLY
    .desc = A white resonant shield generator that projects three nested field layers. A critical overload collapses one layer and vents part of the stored load before the core is exposed.
